skills.gameText:
Automatically activates when hit by an enemy attack the instant any of the first three Basic Attack stages is launched, or when hit by an enemy's non-Control Skill attack while under the [Shimmering Shadow] effect and not Invulnerable:
Dash forward, dealing massive Wind DMG to enemies in the area ahead;
Upon activating this skill, accumulate 15 points of Flowing Breath, and accumulate an additional 20 points of [Flowing Breath] after hitting an enemy;
Hold [Basic Attack button] while this skill is active to quickly launch [Basic Attack: Azure Wind Shadow Hunt], and the final hit of [Basic Attack: Azure Wind Shadow Hunt] accumulates 20 points of [Flowing Breath] when released;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Flowing Breath is sufficient, consume 100 [Flowing Breath] and hold [Basic Attack button] to activate:
Dodge backward and gather momentum, then weave nonstop across the field while unleashing continuous Slashes, dealing massive Wind DMG to enemies in the area ahead;
The backward dodge counts as a dodge; successfully dodging an enemy attack triggers [Vital View] and accumulates 15 [Flowing Breath];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When [Perfect Dodge] is triggered via [Dodge: Drifting Break], press [Basic Attack button] to activate:
Unleashes a rapid slash forward, dealing Wind DMG;
If the character swaps off-field the moment [Perfect Dodge] is triggered via [Dodge: Drifting Break], this skill activates automatically;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

With enough Energy, press [EX Special Attack button] to activate:
Unleash a forward combo of Slash, Claw, and Cannon attacks, dealing massive Wind DMG to enemies and gaining 1 stack of Flickershade;
Hold [EX Special Attack button] to keep consuming Energy before the Cannon attack, continuously unleashing Wind Blades that deal Wind DMG to enemies;
When Energy consumption reaches its maximum, gain 1 extra stack of [Shimmering Shadow];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Severian has the Windrider effect and is in-combat, press [Switch button] to switch from off field to on field to activate:
Unleashes a powerful Slash at enemies in front, dealing Wind DMG;
Upon activating this skill, it counts as activating [Quick Assist];
This skill is not counted as a heavy attack;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Severian's CRIT DMG increases by 60%, and DMG dealt increases by 20%. When another character in your squad is of the Wind attribute, DMG is increased by an additional 30%;
When Severian unleashes [Basic Attack: Swift Edge] at the moment he is about to be hit by an enemy attack, he dodges that attack. If the attack is dodged during the first three stages of his Basic Attack, [Basic Attack: Fierce Whirl] is automatically unleashed. If it happens during the fourth stage, the DMG Multiplier and Daze Multiplier of this Basic Attack are increased to match those of [Basic Attack: Fierce Whirl];
When Severian enters the battlefield, he gains 2 stacks of Flickershade. This effect can trigger once every 180s in Investigation Zone mode;
When Severian has [Glint Shadow] and is not Invulnerable, if he is hit by an enemy attack that is not a Control Skill and fails to actively dodge or parry it, Severian consumes 1 stack of [Glint Shadow] to automatically dodge the attack and unleash [Basic Attack: Fierce Whirl];
Successfully dodging an enemy attack by unleashing [Basic Attack: Swift Edge], automatically dodging an enemy attack via [Glint Shadow], and dodging an enemy attack directly are all considered a [Perfect Dodge];
[Glint Shadow] stacks up to 2 times. If [Glint Shadow] is gained at max stacks, Severian gains 1 stack of Windrider and his next [Basic Attack: Swift Edge] is upgraded to [Basic Attack: Fierce Whirl];
Severian gains 1 stack of [Windborne] with each Perfect Dodge. While Severian has [Windborne] and is in-combat, press [Switch button] to switch from off field to on field and unleash his [Entry Skill];
When Severian hits an enemy with a set skill or triggers a Perfect Dodge, he gains Flowing Breath. [Flowing Breath] caps at 150 points;
When [Flowing Breath] reaches 100 points, hold [Basic Attack button] to consume 100 [Flowing Breath] and unleash [Basic Attack: Azure Wind Shadow Hunt].

The [Flow Breath] accumulated when Severian unleashes [Chain Attack] is increased to 50;
When Severian enters the field via [Entry Skill: Clearing Time], the skill is replaced with [Chain Attack]. This skill's entry type remains unchanged, and it is treated as a non-heavy attack. This effect can trigger once every 60s at most;
Each time Severian unleashes [Basic Attack: Azure Wind Shadowhunt], he gains 1 stack of [Windborne];
When Severian's attacks hit a target, they ignore 15% of that target's Wind RES.

Severian's [Flowing Breath] limit is increased to 180, and the Flowing Breath restored when entering the battlefield is increased to 180 points;
The final hit of [Basic Attack: Azure Wind Shadow Hunt] gains a fixed 350% increase to its additional DMG Multiplier;
When the final hit of [Basic Attack: Azure Wind Shadow Hunt] is unleashed, gain the [Rising Wind] effect: accumulate 5 [Flowing Breath] per second for 5s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.

Press [Basic Attack button] to activate:
Perform up to 4 consecutive attacks forward, dealing Fire DMG;
The 3rd and 4th hits of the [Basic Attack] are considered [Burn Attacks].

When [Blazing Flame] is sufficient, consume 90 [Blazing Flame] and hold [Basic Attack button] to activate:
Phoenix hurls her weapon, dealing massive Fire DMG to enemies in an area ahead;
when the Finishing Move hits an enemy in an Ice Attribute Anomaly state, Ether Anomaly state, Electric Attribute Anomaly state, Fire Attribute Anomaly state, Physical Attribute Anomaly state, or Wind Attribute Anomaly state, it triggers the [Abloom] effect 1 time, dealing Attribute Anomaly DMG of the corresponding attribute with a (225 + 20 × (Basic Attack level − 1))% multiplier;
when this [Abloom] effect triggers a critical hit, its CRIT DMG is additionally increased by 40%;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When [Special Attack: Flame Raid] is used without triggering Perfect Block, press [Basic Attack button] to activate:
Lunge forward, dealing Fire DMG;
Considered a [Burn Attack];
During this skill, press [Basic Attack button] to chain into the third hit of [Basic Attack].

Press [Dodge button] to activate:
A quick dash dodge;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press [Special Attack button] to activate:
After dashing back, swiftly launch a rising attack forward, dealing Fire DMG;
DMG taken is reduced by 40% while dashing back;
When hit at the moment the rising attack begins, or when hitting enemies flashing red or yellow, Perfect Block is triggered, granting immunity to that instance of DMG. Press [Basic Attack button] to directly unleash the third phase of [Basic Attack];
Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.

When [Promotion] is active, consume 1 stack of [Promotion] and press [Special Attack button] to activate:
After a backstep, surge forward with a powerful upward Slash, dealing massive Fire DMG;
Hold [Special Attack button] during the backstep to keep charging;
While charging, release [Special Attack button] to unleash a powerful upward Slash, dealing massive Fire DMG;
When chained after [Burning Attack], skips the backstep and goes straight into the upward attack;
DMG taken is reduced by 40% during the backstep and charge;
Taking a hit the instant the upward Slash begins, or hitting an enemy flashing red or yellow, triggers Perfect Block;
Counts as a [Burning Attack];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill. Press [Basic Attack button] to chain into the 3rd hit of [Basic Attack].

With enough Energy, press [EX Special Attack button] to activate:
Spin the body rapidly, dealing massive Fire DMG to enemies;
Taking an attack at the instant the spin begins, or hitting an enemy flashing red or yellow, triggers the Perfect Block effect;
Considered a [Burn Attack];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill. Press [Basic Attack button] to chain into the third hit of [Basic Attack].

After [EX Special Attack: Dazzling Flame] is used, with enough Energy, press or hold [EX Special Attack button] to activate:
Launch into the air and hurl the weapon, dealing massive Fire DMG to enemies;
Upon activating this skill, gain 1 stack of [Promotion], up to a maximum of 1 stack of [Promotion];
Perfect Block is triggered when taking an attack at the instant the launch begins, or when hitting enemies flashing red or yellow;
Considered a [Burn Attack];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill. Press [Basic Attack button] to chain into the third hit of [Basic Attack].

When a Chain Attack is triggered, select the character to activate:
Unleashes a multi-hit attack forward, dealing Fire DMG;
Considered a [Burning Attack];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill. Press [Basic Attack button] to chain into the third hit of [Basic Attack].

When Decibel Rating is at Maximum, press [Ultimate button] to activate:
Soars high into the air, then dives at enemies, consuming all of the character's own HP to set off an explosion, dealing massive Fire DMG, entering the [Life Drained] state, and triggering the next character's [Quick Assist];
Considered a [Burning Attack];
The character cannot initiate attacks while in the [Life Drained] state;
After using this skill, press [Basic Attack button] to activate [Ultimate: Cinderfire Soulchase];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Phoenix is in the [Life Drain] state, the next time she switches in via standard swap, Quick Assist, or Defensive Assist, the following triggers upon entering the field:
Flames swirl around her, dealing Fire DMG to nearby enemies, exiting the [Life Drain] state, restoring all HP consumed by [Ultimate: Radiance Through Ruin], and additionally restoring HP equal to 10% of her Max HP;
When the Finishing Move hits an enemy afflicted with an Ice Attribute Anomaly, Ether Anomaly, Electric Attribute Anomaly, Fire Attribute Anomaly, Physical Attribute Anomaly, or Wind Attribute Anomaly, it triggers 1 instance of the [Abloom] effect, dealing Attribute Anomaly DMG of the corresponding attribute with a multiplier of (300 + 27 × (Basic Attack level − 1))%;
When this [Abloom] effect triggers a critical hit, its CRIT DMG is further increased by 40%;
When Phoenix enters the field in the [Life Drain] state via [Chain Attack: Snatched from the Brink] or [Ultimate: Radiance Through Ruin], the above HP Recovery and [Abloom] effects are also triggered;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill. Press [Basic Attack button] to chain into the third stage of [Basic Attack].

Upon entering the battlefield, Phoenix gains 1 stack of [Ascension]. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger once every 180s;
Enemies under [Scorch] take an additional 25% Attribute Anomaly CRIT DMG;
When [Burning Attack] deals DMG, [Pyre Flame] acquisition efficiency increases by 15%.

Phoenix ignores 15% of the target's All-Attribute RES;
When Phoenix uses [EX Special Attack: Dazzling Blaze], she gains the [Ascension] effect;
The [Abloom] effect triggered by Phoenix ignores 40% of the enemy's DEF.
